on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint16 1 ............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 73 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  8] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 28] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 12] pushint16 1 ............................. <1>
  [ 15] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 17] extcall 74 .............................. <marker(1)>
  [ 20] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(1)>
  [ 22] extcall 68 .............................. go(marker(1))
  [ 25] jmp [ 39]
  [ 28] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 29] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 31] extcall 74 .............................. <marker(0)>
  [ 34] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 36] extcall 68 .............................. go(marker(0))
  [ 39] ret
end
